<title>USA: CHS files for public offering of shares.</title>
<headline>CHS files for public offering of shares.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>CHS Electronics Inc said Monday it has filed a registration statement with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission for the public offering of up to 10 million shares of common stock.</p>
<p>The company said seven million shares will be offered in the U.S. and Canada, with the rest to be offered in other countries.</p>
<p>CHS distributes microcomputers, peripherals and software products in more than 30 countries in Europe, Latin America and Africa.</p>
<p>((New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
</text>
